==Strategy==
Especially on {{4c}}, the most difficult part of this stage is dealing with the waves of Dashing Faces. Despite their low stats and range, they can be a real pain in numbers. However, each Dashing Face drops loads of money upon death, enough to fund a massive stack of ranged attackers. Once one falls, the rest should follow suit.

Just spam meatshields and [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], along with any ubers you have. If you don't have any, use [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] and/or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]].

